given this basic idea, some TODO I left for the reader:</p>
<ul>
<li>instead of using Regex, use or create a proper <strong>parser</strong> to perform lexical analysis (tokenization) or syntactic analysis (parsing) for the specific languages you want to support in your syntax highlighter.</li>
