Q: Caused by: org.hibernate.MappingException: Could not determine type for: A: <p>It seems that you are mapping a <code>companyId</code> with a <code>userId</code> you also need to provide the name of the column like this: <code>@JoinColumn(name="company_id")</code></p>

<p>So you maybe want something like this:</p>

<pre><code>@OneToOne(mappedBy = "companyId", cascade = CascadeType.ALL)
@PrimaryKeyJoinColumn
@JoinColumn(name="company_id")
private CompanyEntity companyId;
</code></pre>
